---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container about__inner">
    <div class="about__heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Wireit</p>
      <h2>Software partners, not just vendors</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body">
      <p class="about__lead">
        Wireit Technologies builds software the way it should be built —
        with a clear plan, honest communication, and code that holds up
        long after launch.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work across the full lifecycle: custom development, technical
        consulting, and ongoing support — plus our own subscription-based
        products, built from the same standards we bring to client work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you need a system built from scratch or an existing one
        untangled, we bring the same discipline: understand the problem
        first, then build the smallest thing that solves it well.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .about__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-coral);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .about__heading h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .about__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .about__lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about__body p:not(.about__lead) {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }

    .about__heading h2 {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>